OL,4,CFine Gael leader wants border poll     
OL,5,Ccriteria talks with London             
OL,6,GThe leader of Fine Gael, Simon Harris, 
OL,7,Ghas said that a conversation between   
OL,8,Gthe British and Irish governments over 
OL,9,Gthe criteria for a border poll would   
OL,10,Gbe "useful".                           
OL,12,FHarris, who is the tanaiste (Irish     
OL,13,Fdeputy prime minister), said he and    
OL,14,Fthe Taoiseach (Irish PM) Micheal       
OL,15,FMartin are "aligned" on the issue.     
OL,17,FHe said there could be joint Irish     
OL,18,Fgovernment proposals on Irish unity    
OL,19,Fpreparation "by the end of the year".  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
